  <title class="- topic/title ">CPU Core Identification</title> 
  <body class="- topic/body "> 
    <draft-comment translate="no" class="- topic/draft-comment ">Converted using FMHtml2Dita version: 2.1.0 
    </draft-comment> 
    <p class="- topic/p ">The CPUID instruction can be used to obtain the processor signatures for CPU core identification. The BIOS must always use the full 32-bit values returned from the CPUID instruction for parsing the processor information. 
    </p> 
    <p class="- topic/p "><ph platform="NVL" class="- topic/ph ">Nova Lake</ph> family processors have Processor Signatures: 
    </p> 
     
    <table id="TABLE_3690B266299640B098ABDA5071615F36" platform="NVL" class="- topic/table "> 
      <tgroup cols="3" class="- topic/tgroup "> 
        <colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="1.00*" class="- topic/colspec " /> 
        <colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="1.43*" class="- topic/colspec " /> 
        <colspec colnum="3" colname="col3" colwidth="1.07*" class="- topic/colspec " /> 
        <thead class="- topic/thead "> 
          <row class="- topic/row "> 
            <entry align="center" class="- topic/entry "> 
              <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b "> Processor Code Name</b> 
            </entry> 
            <entry align="center" class="- topic/entry "> 
              <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b "> Processor Signature CPUID.(EAX=01h):EAX</b> 
            </entry> 
            <entry align="center" class="- topic/entry "> 
              <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b "> FMS Encoding</b> 
            </entry> 
          </row></thead> 
        <tbody class="- topic/tbody "> 
          <row class="- topic/row "> 
            <entry class="- topic/entry "> Nova Lake -S/Sx (Desktop) 
            </entry> 
            <entry align="center" class="- topic/entry "> 
              <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b "> 0x00300F1n</b> 
            </entry> 
            <entry class="- topic/entry "> Processor Family 0x3F, Model 0x01, Stepping n 
            </entry> 
          </row> 
          <row class="- topic/row "> 
            <entry class="- topic/entry "> Nova Lake -U/P/H/Hx (Mobile) 
            </entry> 
            <entry align="center" class="- topic/entry "> 
              <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b "> 0x00300F3n</b> 
            </entry> 
            <entry class="- topic/entry ">Processor Family 0x3F, Model 0x03, Stepping n
            </entry> 
          </row> 
        </tbody> 
      </tgroup> 
    </table> 
     
     
     
     
